#: src/uagent/web.py:926
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"## Generative UI (Artifacts) Instructions\n"
"When the user asks for a UI, dashboard, interactive tool, or "
"visualization:\n"
"1. Write a complete, self-contained HTML page inside a single ```html "
"code block.\n"
"2. Use Tailwind CSS (via CDN: <script "
"src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>) for styling and Lucide "
"Icons or FontAwesome for icons.\n"
"3. Include interactive JavaScript (e.g., Chart.js for charts, or simple "
"state management).\n"
"4. Do not split the code into multiple blocks; keep it in one unified "
"```html block.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"## Generative UI (Artifacts) Instruktioner\n"
"När användaren ber om ett användargränssnitt, instrumentpanel, "
"interaktivt verktyg eller visualisering:\n"
"1. Skriv en komplett, självförsörjande HTML-sida i ett enda ```html-"
"kodblock.\n"
"2. Använd Tailwind CSS (via CDN: <script "
"src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>) för styling och Lucide "
"Icons eller FontAwesome för ikoner.\n"
"3. Inkludera interaktiv JavaScript (t.ex. Chart.js för diagram, eller "
"enkel tillståndshantering).\n"
"4. Dela inte upp koden i flera block; håll den i ett enda enhetligt "
"```html-block.\n"

